## How it was reached
- **Stage 1–2**: Baseline Chen2020 (400.3 Wh/kg, anode −0.44 V) → idealized ceiling (487.3) confirmed below target → **escalated to Stage 2 materials** (plan_update1): LNMO 4.7 V high-voltage system + HiTrans-class transport + mass-cut architecture. Additive set FEC/VC/PES/DTD passed the three-model funnel (4/4; PES dispute resolved by reasoning).
- **Stage 3–4** (R3→R9): ED chain 492.8 → 622.6 → **597.9** (final mass-cut + transport + N/P trade). Plating was the binding constraint — anode min went **−0.128 → −0.041 → −0.005 → +0.015 V** via N/P 1.39→1.92 (neg 122→180 µm), negative porosity 0.22→0.32, electrolyte D 4e-10→1e-9 m²/s, σ 3.5→6 S/m (LiFSI-class estimates, estimate-marked), separator ε 0.55.
- **Stage 5**: true DFT/MD skipped honestly (real_compute=false) — recorded in the endorse entry, no fabricated values.

## Audit & deliverables
- **log.jsonl**: 23 entries — entry0 criteria → plan ×2 → propose R3–R9 → funnel → evaluate R1–R9 (mechanical verdicts) → endorse (skip, honest) → final (achieved). Every propose has a same-round evaluate.
- **report.html** rendered from the log (346 KB).
