**Honest limitations carried into the deliverables**: electrolyte transport values are domain estimates pending true MD; cycle life, abuse tests, low-temperature, and rate-pulse marked N/A (beyond simulation boundary); with-electrolyte ED would be ~501 Wh/kg (informational, still passing).
